        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You magically assemble a barricade using nearby items, junk and scrap. The barricade occupies a 5-foot square and provides lesser cover for you and one ally, though you can [[/act take-cover]] to increase this benefit to standard cover. The barricade has Hardness 15 and 54 HP. When destroyed, the junk barricade creates an area of clutter that is difficult terrain.</p>"
